{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4798","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4798/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4798/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4798/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/4798","id":111930714,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMTE5MzA3MTQ=","number":4798,"title":"Should only fire output property once even if both in [outputs] and decorated w/ @Output","user":{"login":"wardbell","id":129061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTA2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell","html_url":"https://github.com/wardbell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wardbell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null},{"id":218358951,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTgzNTg5NTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/effort1:%20hours","name":"effort1: hours","color":"bfe5bf","default":false,"description":null},{"id":226601219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjY2MDEyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/open%20for%20contributions","name":"open for contributions","color":"008672","default":false,"description":"An issue that is suitable for a community contributor (based on its complexity/scope)."}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2015-10-16T23:46:31Z","updated_at":"2019-09-07T20:21:15Z","closed_at":"2016-01-12T00:49:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Consider this component:\n\n```\n@Component({\n  selector: 'hero-detail',\n  inputs: ['hero'],\n  outputs: ['deleted'],\n  template: `\n    <div>\n      <b>Hero Detail: {{hero?.fullName}}</b>\n      <button (click)=\"onDelete()\">Delete</button>\n    </div>\n  `\n})\nclass HeroDetailComponent {\n\n  @Input()\n  hero: Hero;\n\n  @Output()\n  deleted = new EventEmitter();\n\n  onDelete() {\n    this.deleted.next(this.hero);\n  }\n}\n```\n\nNow we bind to it:\n\n```\n<hero-detail [hero]=\"currentHero\" (deleted)=\"onDeleted($event)\"></hero-detail>\n```\n\nWhen the user clicks the Delete button inside `<hero-detail>`, the parent's `onDeleted` method is called twice.\n\nRemove either the `[outputs]` array or the `@Output` decoration and the  parent's method is called only once.\n\nThe number of parent method calls increase by one for each additional `@Output` decoration.\n\nI maintain that any number of mentions as an output > 1  should still mean a single call to the parent method.\n","closed_by":{"login":"rkirov","id":95713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov","html_url":"https://github.com/rkirov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkirov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4798/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4798/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}